  <p class="lede">hi, i’m vicenzo — an iOS developer who cares a lot about how software feels to use, mostly because of <em class="accent">Apple’s design principles</em>.</p>
  <p>i’m at the apple developer academy until november 2026, studying software engineering at pucrs alongside it. two of the things i’ve built are on the app store — <a href="/projects/shiro/">shiro</a>, an arcade climber, and <a href="/projects/every-minute/">every minute</a>, an escape room for vision pro — and most of my work is swift, swiftui, and the composable architecture.</p>
  <p>outside of that i swim, listen to a lot of ambient music and aphex twin, think about game design, and keep rebuilding my terminal setup on linux and macos.</p>
